  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#scriptingLanguages could be read as meaning that we restrict what MIME types JavaScript can load with. HTML doesn't however restrict that, it only means to restrict what can go in `<script type>`. \r\n\r\n(Fetch does blocklist some MIME types for script loads and that list might grow over time, but that's a somewhat separate effort.)\r\n\r\nBackground: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1333995.",
